SUMMARY:AAI-501 Project: repo + CI + pull data
DESCRIPTION:M0 + start of M3. Slotted at 1pm to stay clear of the 9am Friday discussion/assignment block.\n\n1. Create the GitHub project repo and README.\n2. Push the staged CI from github_ci_setup/ (lint.yml + ruff.toml) and confirm the Ruff Linter check goes green in Actions.\n3. Download LLMRouterBench bench-release (github.com/ynulihao/LLMRouterBench).\n4. Reshape the JSON records from wide per-model to long/tidy.\n\nGitHub is a graded requirement and the repo is not live yet.
LOCATION:Home
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:aai501-proj-eda-label-20260718@bucketbranch.com
DTSTAMP:20260717T041500Z
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T173000
SUMMARY:AAI-501 Project: EDA + DEFINE THE ROUTING LABEL
DESCRIPTION:M3 core. Slotted at 3pm to stay clear of the 10am Saturday deep-work block and the 1pm Status Update prep block already on the calendar.\n\n1. EDA: cost and score distributions per model, token counts, task mix.\n2. DEFINE THE ROUTING LABEL: the cheapest model that clears a quality threshold.\n\nThe label rule is the highest-risk design decision in this project. Write the threshold down and be ready to defend it. Plan a sensitivity check so it does not look arbitrary.
LOCATION:Home
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:aai501-proj-baseline-20260719@bucketbranch.com
DTSTAMP:20260717T041500Z
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T153000
SUMMARY:AAI-501 Project: features + baseline router (4.3 ready)
DESCRIPTION:M3 finish - sets up the 4.3 Status Update due Mon Jul 20. Slotted at 1pm to stay clear of the 10am Sunday quiz review block.\n\n1. Light feature set: prompt_tokens, task category. No text embeddings (keeps preprocessing light).\n2. Baseline logistic regression router.\n3. Reference baselines: always-cheapest and always-strongest cost + quality.\n4. Split by prompt so the same prompt never lands on both sides of train/test (leakage guard).\n5. Write up the 4.3 Status Update from these results.
LOCATION:Home
END:VEVENT
